---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Same 6.5 percent rise in the dollar rate: an exporter with USD 10 million revenue and 200 billion VND costs goes from 30 to 45 billion VND profit; an importer buying USD 8 million of inputs goes from 26 to 14 billion.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>One weaker dong, two opposite results</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng một đồng yếu đi, hai kết quả ngược nhau</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="52" width="420" height="210" rx="10" class="cardk" />
      <DiagramIcon name="package" x={50} y={82} size={26} />
      <text x="76" y="88" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Exporter (earns USD, pays VND)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhà xuất khẩu (thu USD, chi VND)</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="120" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Assume revenue USD 10m, VND costs 200 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giả sử doanh thu 10 triệu USD, chi phí VND 200 tỷ</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="150" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>At 23,000 đ/USD: profit 30 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ở 23.000 đ/USD: lãi 30 tỷ</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="176" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>At 24,500 đ/USD: profit 45 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ở 24.500 đ/USD: lãi 45 tỷ</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="222" class="grn"><tspan data-lang-en>Change: +50%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thay đổi: +50%</tspan></text>
      <rect x="460" y="52" width="420" height="210" rx="10" class="cardr" />
      <DiagramIcon name="receipt" x={490} y={82} size={26} />
      <text x="516" y="88" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Importer (pays USD, sells in VND)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhà nhập khẩu (trả USD, bán bằng VND)</tspan></text>
      <text x="478" y="120" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Assume sales 250 bn, USD inputs 8m, other costs 40 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giả sử bán 250 tỷ, nguyên liệu 8 triệu USD, chi phí khác 40 tỷ</tspan></text>
      <text x="478" y="150" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>At 23,000 đ/USD: profit 26 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ở 23.000 đ/USD: lãi 26 tỷ</tspan></text>
      <text x="478" y="176" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>At 24,500 đ/USD: profit 14 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ở 24.500 đ/USD: lãi 14 tỷ</tspan></text>
      <text x="478" y="222" class="red"><tspan data-lang-en>Change: -46%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thay đổi: -46%</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>All company numbers here are assumptions for the arithmetic (USD rates 23,000 and 24,500 are roughly the central rate and the bank quote of October 2022). Real companies also hold USD loans and hedges: read the foreign-exchange note in their statements.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Số của hai công ty ở đây là giả định để tính. Tỷ giá 23.000 và 24.500 xấp xỉ tỷ giá trung tâm và giá ngân hàng tháng 10/2022. Doanh nghiệp thật còn có nợ USD và công cụ phòng ngừa: hãy đọc thuyết minh chênh lệch tỷ giá trong báo cáo của họ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08exporterimporter figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
